From: Long Way Home <noreply@long-way-home.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] attach points for Long Way Home's own game logic

Seventeen one-line calls and a build option. The logic itself is not in this tree: it is compiled
in from LWH_MODULE_DIR (the long-way-home repository's module/), and game/lwh_hooks.h turns every
call into an empty inline when that is unset, so this patch alone changes no behaviour.

Two systems attach here, the crew direction layer (Crew_*) and the ship simulation (Ship_*):
  G_InitCvars / InitGame       register cvars; start once the map's entities exist
  G_RunFrame (first, last)     the frame clock, then each system's turn after every entity has thought
  ShutdownGame                 the ship's state is carried through a level change
  NPC_Use / NPC_Respond        time the player's address against the acknowledgement
  NPC_Touch                    being walked into
  G_LoadSave_*MiscData         one optional save chunk each, written only while the system is on
  ConsoleCommand               the "crew" and "ship" server commands
---
diff --git a/efgame/CMakeLists.txt b/efgame/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/efgame/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/efgame/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -82,8 +82,21 @@
 list(REMOVE_ITEM EFGAME_SRC
   ${SRC}/icarus/Interface.cpp ${SRC}/icarus/Interpreter.cpp ${SRC}/icarus/Tokenizer.cpp)
 
+# Long Way Home: game logic that is ours lives outside this tree and is compiled in from
+# LWH_MODULE_DIR (the long-way-home repository's module/). Unset, the hooks in game/lwh_hooks.h
+# are no-ops and this builds exactly as upstream does.
+set(LWH_MODULE_DIR "" CACHE PATH "Directory of additional game-module sources")
+if(LWH_MODULE_DIR)
+  file(GLOB_RECURSE LWH_MODULE_SRC ${LWH_MODULE_DIR}/*.cpp)
+  list(APPEND EFGAME_SRC ${LWH_MODULE_SRC})
+endif()
+
 add_library(efgame SHARED ${EFGAME_SRC})
 target_include_directories(efgame PRIVATE ${EF_INCLUDES})
+if(LWH_MODULE_DIR)
+  target_include_directories(efgame PRIVATE ${LWH_MODULE_DIR}/crew ${LWH_MODULE_DIR}/ship)
+  target_compile_definitions(efgame PRIVATE LWH_CREW)
+endif()
 target_compile_options(efgame PRIVATE ${EF_COPTS})
 target_compile_definitions(efgame PRIVATE NDEBUG)
 target_link_options(efgame PRIVATE
